---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const beta = 'https://gobk-checkup-beta.jimmydanol.chatgpt.site';
const frameScript = `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}checkup-beta-frame.js`;
---
<Base title="Bankruptcy Checkup (Beta)" description="Explore your budget and bankruptcy options with invented answers. Draft educational guidance.">
  <section class="section beta-section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="beta-heading"><h1>Bankruptcy Checkup (Beta)</h1><a href={beta} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open full screen ↗</a></div>
      <p class="lede">Explore your budget and which bankruptcy options to discuss.</p>
      <p class="beta-notice"><strong>Invented data only. Draft, not attorney-approved.</strong> Do not enter real consumer data. No filing or eligibility verdict.</p>
      <iframe data-gobk-checkup-beta src={beta} title="Bankruptcy Checkup (Beta) synthetic-data questionnaire" loading="eager" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" sandbox="allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-forms allow-popups"></iframe>
      <nav class="beta-links" aria-label="Checkup workflow"><a href="/bankruptcy-checkup-beta-workflow">See the workflow</a><a href="/bankruptcy-checkup-beta-workflow-interactive">Explore the interactive workflow</a></nav>
      <details class="beta-about"><summary>About this beta</summary>
        <p>Is bankruptcy worth exploring, and which chapter should you ask about first? Try invented answers. A chapter discussion starting point is not an eligibility finding or an instruction to file. A surplus does not rule bankruptcy out; a shortfall does not prove you should file.</p>
        <p>No signup, email, saved assessment or uploads. Eligibility, property protection and debt discharge are not determined.</p>
        <p>Individuals may represent themselves; the <a href="https://www.uscourts.gov/court-programs/bankruptcy/filing-without-attorney" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">U.S. Courts recommends qualified legal help</a>. <a href="https://www.consumerfinance.gov/ask-cfpb/how-do-i-find-an-attorney-in-my-state-en-1549/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Find legal help</a>.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
<script is:inline src={frameScript}></script>
<style>
  .beta-section { padding-top: var(--space-4); }
  .beta-heading { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .5rem 1rem; }
  h1 { margin-bottom: .5rem; }
  .beta-heading a, .beta-links, .beta-about { font-size: .9rem; }
  .lede { margin-bottom: .5rem; }
  .beta-notice { border-left: 3px solid var(--sage); padding: .55rem .8rem; background: var(--paper, #f7f5ef); margin-block: .5rem 1rem; font-size: .85rem; }
  iframe { display: block; width: 100%; height: 1000px; border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-radius: 8px; background: #f7f5ef; }
  .beta-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .5rem 1.5rem; margin-block: 1rem; }
  .beta-about { border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); padding-top: .75rem; }
  .beta-about summary { cursor: pointer; }
  .beta-about p { margin-block: .75rem; }
  @media (max-width: 40rem) { iframe { height: 900px; } }
</style>
